cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use LogShield in research or documentation, please cite it as below."
title: "LogShield: a Log4Shell virtual-patch reverse proxy"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Verma
    given-names: Pranav
repository-code: "https://github.com/TurlaFSB/logshield"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A defensive reverse proxy that detects and blocks Log4Shell (CVE-2021-44228
  and related) payloads in front of applications that cannot be patched,
  validated against a real vulnerable Log4j in an isolated lab.
keywords:
  - log4shell
  - cve-2021-44228
  - virtual patching
  - reverse proxy
  - compensating control
